Demo data
---------
harness/run.sh demo-room and demo-room2 download room_scan1.pcd and room_scan2.pcd
from the Point Cloud Library data repository at runtime
(https://github.com/PointCloudLibrary/data, commit
084fa0e260580cc765ded83de4ec3f495f1d6f1e). These files are not redistributed in this
repository. The images docs/images/room_scan*.png and docs/images/tutorial/room/*.png
are renderings derived from them.

The input.transform in examples/room_scan2/config.yaml uses the initial alignment
estimate (rotation 0.6931 rad about z, translation 1.79387, 0.720047, 0) from the PCL
tutorial source doc/tutorials/content/sources/normal_distributions_transform/
normal_distributions_transform.cpp (https://github.com/PointCloudLibrary/pcl, commit
1144afdb3ae941fa6cfab462850bfc96f72695ec), which is distributed under the PCL BSD
license.
